# Fikiri task routing

Pick one class. Domain rules are in `.cursorrules`. Read the subsystem file named there before editing that area. Do not re-read `.cursorrules`.

## Quick fix

Copy, styling, or a localized bug in a known area. Search, then open only the files the search names. Smallest patch. Tests: `docs/REGRESSION_TESTING.md`.

## Feature

One subsystem or endpoint. Name the files before opening more. A short outline only when the API or schema changes. Tests: `docs/REGRESSION_TESTING.md`.

## Architecture

Auth, billing, permissions, migrations, queues, or a cross-service change. State the contract, data change, and rollback before editing. This class is critical. Tests: `docs/REGRESSION_TESTING.md`.

## MCP and external systems

Render, Supabase, Neon, Vercel, Windmill, or the browser, and only for live state the repo cannot answer.

- Inspect that one namespace, then one tool. Do not load the full tool catalog.
- One filtered call, then stop.
- Deploy, migrate, or change production data only when the user asked in this turn.

## Stop

Report the files changed, the checks you ran, and anything still broken. Do not restate the task.
